{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/378225-muisc-that-represents-wod","id":378225,"title":"Muisc that Represents WoD","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-22T11:18:18-08:00","id":378225,"title":"Muisc that Represents WoD","content":"Thought I'd ask what bands and or songs everyone thinks can do a good job at capturing the World of Darkness.<br /> <br /> Here are my picks<br /> <br /> <b><u>Vampire the Masquerade</u></b><br /> The Deeper the Night by Steeler<br /> Flesh to Flesh by Joe Lamont: I feel this could be a fun theme for Sabat Shovelheads<br /> Justified by Drea: I feel this could be used for the theme of an Elder<br /> <br /> <b><u>Hunters Hunted</u></b><br /> Alone in the Night by Leather Wolf<br /> <br /> <b><u>Werewolf the Apocalypse</u></b><br /> Undercover Animal by Steeler<br /> Think about the Way by Ice MC: For Children of Gaia<br /> <br /> <b><u>Mage the Ascension</u></b><br /> Quicksilver by The Cruxshadows<br /> <br /> <b><u>Wraith the Oblivion</u></b><br /> Separate Ways by Journey<br /> Getting Away with Murder by Papa Roach: Shadow Theme Song<br /> <br /> <b><u>Changeling the Dreaming</u></b><br /> Cartoon Heros by Aqua<br /> See Who I Am by: Within Temptation<br /> <br /> <b><u>Hunter the Reckoning</u></b><br /> The Saints are coming by U2 and Greenday<br /> Invincible by Pat Benatar<br /> Last Sunrise by Aiden<br /> <br /> <b><u>Demon the Fallen</u></b><br /> Devil is a Loser by Lordi: Earthbound theme right here<br /> <br /> <b><u>Multiple</u></b><br /> Hunter or Hunted by Steeler: Both HH and HtR:<br /> To Myself I Turned by Lacuna Coil: I believe this could work for both Changeling and Mage<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2256-goblin404","name":"Goblin4